{
  "source": "audio/vampire_finch/ep02_vo_full_sp95_s74_sb75_m2.mp3",
  "speed": 0.95,
  "measured_wpm": 155.2,
  "source_duration_s": 199.863,
  "blocks": 37,
  "segments": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_00_0m00.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 0,
      "timecode": "0:00",
      "src_in": 0.0,
      "src_out": 6.53,
      "duration": 6.53,
      "text": "Right now, on a bare rock in the Pacific, this seabird is being drained — one drop at a time.",
      "match_ratio": 0.947
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_01_0m07.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 7,
      "timecode": "0:07",
      "src_in": 6.53,
      "src_out": 13.45,
      "duration": 6.92,
      "text": "Not by a shark. Not by a storm. But by a bird small enough to sit in the palm of your hand.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_02_0m15.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 15,
      "timecode": "0:15",
      "src_in": 13.45,
      "src_out": 16.8,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "text": "And out here, there is nowhere left to run.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_03_0m20.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 20,
      "timecode": "0:20",
      "src_in": 16.8,
      "src_out": 22.87,
      "duration": 6.07,
      "text": "It has tried everything — shaking them off, snapping, twisting away.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_04_0m27.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 27,
      "timecode": "0:27",
      "src_in": 22.87,
      "src_out": 25.45,
      "duration": 2.58,
      "text": "They simply hop back on.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_05_0m31.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 31,
      "timecode": "0:31",
      "src_in": 25.45,
      "src_out": 32.23,
      "duration": 6.78,
      "text": "Every hour, a little more of its blood is carried off — and the great bird just... endures it.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_06_0m41.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 41,
      "timecode": "0:41",
      "src_in": 32.23,
      "src_out": 36.34,
      "duration": 4.11,
      "text": "As if being slowly emptied were somehow the safer choice.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_07_1m05.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 65,
      "timecode": "1:05",
      "src_in": 36.34,
      "src_out": 46.67,
      "duration": 10.33,
      "text": "This is a ground finch. A seed-eater — the same unremarkable little bird Darwin watched cracking seeds on these islands, two centuries ago.",
      "match_ratio": 0.913
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_08_1m16.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 76,
      "timecode": "1:16",
      "src_in": 46.67,
      "src_out": 49.62,
      "duration": 2.95,
      "text": "It has no business wanting blood at all.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_09_1m22.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 82,
      "timecode": "1:22",
      "src_in": 49.62,
      "src_out": 56.93,
      "duration": 7.31,
      "text": "So how did a seed-eater learn to drink blood — and why does a seabird twenty times its size simply let it happen?",
      "match_ratio": 0.957
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_10_1m40.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 100,
      "timecode": "1:40",
      "src_in": 56.93,
      "src_out": 62.05,
      "duration": 5.12,
      "text": "It works the base of a growing feather, where the blood runs closest to the skin...",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_11_2m08.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 128,
      "timecode": "2:08",
      "src_in": 62.05,
      "src_out": 66.09,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "text": "And for the first time in days, the seabird goes perfectly still.",
      "match_ratio": 0.917
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_12_2m25.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 145,
      "timecode": "2:25",
      "src_in": 66.09,
      "src_out": 68.45,
      "duration": 2.36,
      "text": "It did not begin as cruelty.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_13_2m29.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 149,
      "timecode": "2:29",
      "src_in": 68.45,
      "src_out": 81.98,
      "duration": 13.53,
      "text": "Long ago, these finches earned their place on the boobies' backs — picking off the ticks and biting flies the big birds could never reach themselves. A fair trade. The seabird got clean; the finch got fed.",
      "match_ratio": 0.972
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_14_2m45.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 165,
      "timecode": "2:45",
      "src_in": 81.98,
      "src_out": 88.61,
      "duration": 6.63,
      "text": "But every so often, a beak broke skin. A bead of blood welled up... and the finch drank.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_15_2m56.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 176,
      "timecode": "2:56",
      "src_in": 88.61,
      "src_out": 93.13,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "text": "And a bird starving on a bare rock does not forget a taste like that.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_16_3m05.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 185,
      "timecode": "3:05",
      "src_in": 93.13,
      "src_out": 101.76,
      "duration": 8.63,
      "text": "Slowly, over generations, the cleaner became the parasite. Today, close to a tenth of everything this finch eats is blood.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_17_3m25.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 205,
      "timecode": "3:25",
      "src_in": 101.76,
      "src_out": 113.7,
      "duration": 11.94,
      "text": "It still cannot make its own water. It still cannot cross the open sea. Everything it needs, it must take — from the only large, warm, living thing for miles.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_18_4m30.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 270,
      "timecode": "4:30",
      "src_in": 113.7,
      "src_out": 120.34,
      "duration": 6.64,
      "text": "Because these are two of the most remote islands in all the Galápagos. Wolf. And Darwin.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_19_4m40.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 280,
      "timecode": "4:40",
      "src_in": 120.34,
      "src_out": 129.26,
      "duration": 8.92,
      "text": "No streams. No soft ground. For half of every year, the rain simply stops — and the seeds run out.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_20_4m52.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 292,
      "timecode": "4:52",
      "src_in": 129.26,
      "src_out": 134.83,
      "duration": 5.57,
      "text": "So the finch drinks whatever it can find. Nectar from a cactus flower.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_21_4m58.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 298,
      "timecode": "4:58",
      "src_in": 134.83,
      "src_out": 137.75,
      "duration": 2.92,
      "text": "Seawater. Even the droppings of other birds.",
      "match_ratio": 0.857
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_22_5m05.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 305,
      "timecode": "5:05",
      "src_in": 137.75,
      "src_out": 140.04,
      "duration": 2.29,
      "text": "And when there is nothing else left at all.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_23_5m10.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 310,
      "timecode": "5:10",
      "src_in": 140.04,
      "src_out": 142.12,
      "duration": 2.08,
      "text": "There is always blood.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_24_5m16.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 316,
      "timecode": "5:16",
      "src_in": 142.12,
      "src_out": 147.43,
      "duration": 5.31,
      "text": "On an island full of seabirds, it is the one thing that never runs dry.",
      "match_ratio": 0.933
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_25_5m45.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 345,
      "timecode": "5:45",
      "src_in": 147.43,
      "src_out": 152.4,
      "duration": 4.97,
      "text": "But there is a deeper reason the seabird will not simply stand up and leave.",
      "match_ratio": 0.933
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_26_5m52.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 352,
      "timecode": "5:52",
      "src_in": 152.4,
      "src_out": 155.7,
      "duration": 3.3,
      "text": "Beneath it, in the dust, is a single egg.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_27_5m58.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 358,
      "timecode": "5:58",
      "src_in": 155.7,
      "src_out": 158.56,
      "duration": 2.86,
      "text": "And these same finches are egg-thieves.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_28_6m03.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 363,
      "timecode": "6:03",
      "src_in": 158.56,
      "src_out": 161.99,
      "duration": 3.43,
      "text": "The instant the booby lifts off to escape the bleeding.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_29_6m07.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 367,
      "timecode": "6:07",
      "src_in": 161.99,
      "src_out": 165.13,
      "duration": 3.14,
      "text": "They take the very thing it was trying to protect.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_30_6m14.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 374,
      "timecode": "6:14",
      "src_in": 165.13,
      "src_out": 173.69,
      "duration": 8.56,
      "text": "So it makes the only choice the island allows. It stays. It shields the egg. And it lets them drink.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_31_7m12.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 432,
      "timecode": "7:12",
      "src_in": 173.69,
      "src_out": 176.2,
      "duration": 2.51,
      "text": "By morning, it is quiet again.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_32_7m17.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 437,
      "timecode": "7:17",
      "src_in": 176.2,
      "src_out": 182.28,
      "duration": 6.08,
      "text": "The finches settle back onto the bird they feed on, as though nothing had passed between them.",
      "match_ratio": 0.941
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_33_7m24.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 444,
      "timecode": "7:24",
      "src_in": 182.28,
      "src_out": 186.45,
      "duration": 4.17,
      "text": "The seabird keeps its egg. The finch keeps its life.",
      "match_ratio": 0.9
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_34_7m35.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 455,
      "timecode": "7:35",
      "src_in": 186.45,
      "src_out": 193.84,
      "duration": 7.39,
      "text": "Out here, at the far edge of the world, survival is not kindness — and it is not cruelty.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_35_7m44.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 464,
      "timecode": "7:44",
      "src_in": 193.84,
      "src_out": 196.38,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "text": "It is only the bargain the island allows...",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "file": "audio/vampire_finch/blocks/vo_36_7m48.mp3",
      "drop_at_s": 468,
      "timecode": "7:48",
      "src_in": 196.38,
      "src_out": 199.863,
      "duration": 3.483,
      "text": "Paid one drop of blood at a time.",
      "match_ratio": 1.0
    }
  ]
}